/// 製造ラインを構成する個別生産設備（真空ろう付け炉・CNC研削盤・巻線機・検査装置）。
entity 'mes#Equipment'
	namespace: mes
	keyProperty: equipment_id
	displayNameProperty: equipment_name
	synonyms: ["設備", "マシン", "号機", "加工機", "製造装置", "炉", "ろう付け炉", "研削盤", "Machine", "Asset"]

	annotation domainOwner = "Maintenance"
	annotation sopAnchorDocs = "DOC-SOP-VBF204;DOC-SOP-CNC101"

	property equipment_id
		dataType: string
		isKey
		sourceColumn: mes_equipment.equipment_id

	property equipment_name
		dataType: string
		sourceColumn: mes_equipment.equipment_name

	property equipment_type
		dataType: string
		sourceColumn: mes_equipment.equipment_type

	property calibration_cycle_days
		dataType: int64
		sourceColumn: mes_equipment.calibration_cycle_days
		annotation unit = "days"

	property days_since_calibration
		dataType: int64
		sourceColumn: mes_equipment.days_since_calibration
		annotation unit = "days"

	/// 設備の現在稼働状態コード
	property operating_state_code
		dataType: int64
		sourceColumn: mes_equipment.operating_state_code
		annotation stateCodeMap = "1=NormalRunning, 2=DegradedWarning, 3=MaintenanceHold"
